    <string name="fork_whats_new_summary">Changes against the original</string>
    <string name="fork_changes">• Categories style of the app menu, with a tile mosaic: 7 sizes, long-press menu, dragging, Compact\n• A categories page on the home screen\n• Recently installed: 4×1, 2×2 and 4×2\n• Columns in a category: Auto, As in the menu, 3–5\n• Choosing large icons, category icons\n• Per-folder columns, tint, name and icon\n• Ukrainian and Russian languages\n• Smart folders know Ukrainian apps, with new Shopping and Government and mobile (turn Smart folders off and on to sort again)\n• A weekly backup, with a copy in a folder you choose</string>
